  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Enhanced Integrated Framework (EIF) for Trade for Least Developed Countries Development Phase 2 - technical and financial support for countries to integrate into global trade.</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This activity Enhanced Integrated Framework (EIF) for Trade for Least Developed Countries Development Phase 2 - technical and financial support for countries to integrate into global trade. is a component of Enhanced Integrated Framework (EIF) Trade for Least Developed Countries Development Phase 2 reported by FCDO with a funding type of 109 - Multilateral organisation and a budget of &#xa3;6,500,000. This project benefits Developing countries, unspecified. It works in the following sector(s): Trade policy and administrative management, Agricultural development, Multilateral trade negotiations, Trade facilitation.</narrative>
  </description>
